# One search turn after INCURSION_DAMAGE_CLASS_PROBE=1 has staged and run its
# sixteen damage-class cases (src/DamageClassProbe.cpp, called once at the start
# of Game::Play). The probe finishes before this turn; the turn exists so that
# tools/headless.sh counts the run as a session (it reports NO GAMEPLAY, exit 5,
# when no turn completes) and so that a crash after the probe still shows.
#
#   INCURSION_OPTIONS=tools/fixtures/options-2026-08-22.dat \
#   INCURSION_LOAD=tools/fixtures/chars/orc-barbarian-seed1-opt0822.sav \
#   INCURSION_DAMAGE_CLASS_PROBE=1 INCURSION_FORCE_SAVE_ROLL=1 \
#       tools/headless.sh tools/keys/damage-class.keys 1
#
# Read tools/check_damage_class.sh; it owns the verdict. inc-kx693.

@dump:arrival

s               # search: one real turn
@dump:played
